e to use in the  one-shot game mode and look how it melts  everyone as long as you didn't get too  cocky three wins were coming your way  number eight chapter two gave us the  greatest meme ideas ever  like the cuttlefish this pink squid  could be used for so many meme strats i  mean they could be hidden in plain sight  underneath loot the best two meme ideas  i saw were hiding them under supply  drops and waiting for someone to come  past to open it they'd be met with this  another was to throw them inside  vehicles smashing the windows then  throwing them on the seats and then when  another player started driving boom  instant classic cuddle fish may be my  favorite thing to happen in fortnite in  2021 yes  yes  yes we're on to the top seven now and we  have to pay homage to the reboot van  meem hiding on top of the reboot van  this strat became synonymous with the  frozen love ranger skin who blended in  so well to the blue glow above the van  memez would first grab a shotty then  sitting waiting at the reboot van ready  to pounce on any unsuspecting players  just trying to reboot their teammates  this tactic is still used today three  years later we can still hide on top of  the reboot fans and i'd say this was  inspiration for the sapling meme from  earlier in the video oh god damn it  number six chapter two gave us the  ability to fish and a slurp factory  which could heal us constantly thanks to  an outlet pipe which fed into the  swampland by teaming up both of these  skills together it was possible to win a  game of fortnite in the storm the strat  was to catch as many fish and pick up as  many white heels as possible then set up  your home base around that waste pipe  from there all you had to do was consume  and eat every time your health got low  and if you were lucky enough you would  get the dog  let's go number five were you playing  fortnite when the zero point floated  high in the sky season five of chapter  two let us jump into the zero point and  