d number one okay so my pick for the  greatest meme strat in fortnite history  is all thanks to this skin mystique who  has the ability to shapeshift into  anyone she eliminates this was a great  way to try skins before you bought them  or to wear an og skin you may have  missed but memes took this power and  made a strategy like no other they would  find the latest npc to join the island  and take them out then using mystique's  ability they'd replace them performing  all their actions and you know what  happens when another player came over  they'd attack them hilarious for the  memer but devastating for the unknown  casual now in chapter three i can  finally get my hands on the original  paradigm skin i missed all the way back  in chapter 1. it feels good as for the  meme i don't think it will ever end  shoot now  so that's my list do you agree what did  i miss please let me know in the  comments if we get enough we'll make a  part two i'm adam you're awesome here's  some legends who used my code this time  from my discord thanks for watching i'll  see you next time  [Music]

